WEBVTT

00:00.880 --> 00:07.400
Dear Mother, I met Grandfather so that he could choose whether Rosemary or I was the real Nadja.

00:08.120 --> 00:09.850
Something unbelievable happened.

00:10.760 --> 00:13.570
Francis said that he was the Black Rose...

00:14.290 --> 00:16.860
He and I were arrested by the police.

00:26.670 --> 00:27.830
NAAJA

00:26.670 --> 00:27.830
Nadja

00:27.860 --> 00:30.330
kimi no hitomi ni wa

00:27.880 --> 00:30.330
With your eyes

00:30.330 --> 00:31.490
NAAJA

00:30.380 --> 00:31.490
Nadja

00:31.510 --> 00:33.760
nani ga mieru

00:31.510 --> 00:33.760
What do you see?

00:33.980 --> 00:36.870
haruka tooku hikaru

00:33.980 --> 00:36.870
Shining in the far distance,

00:37.020 --> 00:39.160
mirai no tobira

00:37.020 --> 00:39.160
The door to the future,

00:40.300 --> 00:43.710
sagashiteiru

00:40.300 --> 00:43.710
That's what I'm searching for

00:43.710 --> 00:50.920
Tomorrow's Nadja

00:51.630 --> 00:55.040
If everyone could meet with a smile

00:55.140 --> 00:58.400
arasoimo kitto nakunaru

00:55.140 --> 00:58.400
I'm sure there would be no more fighting

00:58.470 --> 01:01.850
kon nani mo tanoshiku naru

00:58.500 --> 01:01.850
It could be so much more fun

01:01.880 --> 01:05.330
sekai wa hiruikedo hitotsune

01:01.880 --> 01:05.330
The world is wide, but it's still one

01:05.700 --> 01:09.060
tabi no owari wa mienai

01:05.700 --> 01:09.060
I can't see the end of the journey

01:09.090 --> 01:12.250
kamisama ga tabun shitteru

01:09.090 --> 01:12.250
God is the only one who can possibly know

01:12.420 --> 01:16.070
itsukamata deaeru hito tachi ni

01:12.420 --> 01:16.070
To the people who, someday, I will meet again

01:16.070 --> 01:18.220
te wo furinagara

01:16.070 --> 01:18.220
I will go waving

01:18.370 --> 01:25.110
toki ni wa BURUU ni naru himo aru kedo

01:18.370 --> 01:25.110
Sometimes, there are days I feel blue,

01:25.110 --> 01:27.850
ushiro mukanai

01:25.110 --> 01:27.850
But I won't look back

01:28.120 --> 01:33.160
yume ga kanau hima de

01:28.120 --> 01:33.160
Until the day my dream comes true

01:33.330 --> 01:36.710
NAAJA kimi no hoho emi wa

01:33.330 --> 01:36.710
Nadja, your smile

01:36.790 --> 01:39.990
NAAJA yuuki ni naru

01:36.790 --> 01:39.990
Nadja, you give me courage

01:40.290 --> 01:43.250
aoi sora no shita de

01:40.290 --> 01:43.250
Under the blue sky

01:43.230 --> 01:46.040
ashita no yukue

01:43.230 --> 01:46.040
I will find the place

01:46.560 --> 01:50.190
mitsu kerukara

01:46.560 --> 01:50.190
Where my future lies

01:55.030 --> 01:58.440
Vienna

01:59.620 --> 02:00.480
What!?

02:02.090 --> 02:03.720
The Black Rose has been arrested?

02:04.110 --> 02:07.020
He is from the Harcourt family...

02:07.440 --> 02:08.700
W-what is this?

02:09.270 --> 02:10.430
Guh, Nadja is...!

02:11.220 --> 02:12.650
Just what is happening?

02:13.660 --> 02:18.210
Vienna Police

02:25.070 --> 02:26.260
I can't believe it.

02:27.590 --> 02:29.840
Francis, why did you...?

02:30.770 --> 02:31.420
I am...

02:33.000 --> 02:34.630
I am the Black Rose.

02:36.130 --> 02:38.580
Was he trying to cover for Keith?

02:39.460 --> 02:42.350
Even if they argue, Keith is still his older twin brother.

02:45.610 --> 02:47.220
Rosemary Applefield.

02:47.640 --> 02:48.480
Your breakfast.

02:49.440 --> 02:50.030
Wait!

02:53.410 --> 02:54.920
I am not Rosemary!

02:55.170 --> 02:55.980
I am Nadja.

02:56.420 --> 02:58.840
And...Francis isn't the Black Rose!

03:01.240 --> 03:03.860
If you have something to say, say it during the police inquiry.

03:05.460 --> 03:06.180
Wait!

03:06.770 --> 03:08.180
Wait!!

03:14.250 --> 03:15.010
Mother...

03:15.630 --> 03:16.960
I won't give up!

03:23.200 --> 03:27.500
Silence! The Captured White Rose

03:35.800 --> 03:36.980
Good morning.

03:44.270 --> 03:44.930
Francis...

03:48.190 --> 03:49.010
Francis.

03:50.270 --> 03:51.060
Mary Ann...

03:53.400 --> 03:54.140
Francis...

03:55.130 --> 03:57.990
Going back and forth, they finally let me see you.

04:04.260 --> 04:04.860
How cruel!

04:05.800 --> 04:09.280
Making the successor to the Harcourt Dukedom go through such sufferings.

04:10.120 --> 04:11.520
I'll make a diplomatic problem out of it.

04:11.600 --> 04:12.310
It's fine.

04:12.810 --> 04:13.470
Mary Ann.

04:15.550 --> 04:16.880
This is what I wanted.

04:17.320 --> 04:18.110
That can't be.

04:20.240 --> 04:21.150
It's Keith.

04:21.470 --> 04:22.630
Keith is the Black Rose.

04:23.590 --> 04:25.300
That's why you're covering for Keith.

04:28.330 --> 04:29.170
Why...

04:30.210 --> 04:33.070
Keith should be the one to take responsibility for the things he did.

04:33.890 --> 04:35.910
There is no need for you to be his substitute...

04:39.320 --> 04:40.230
Because of that girl...

04:42.550 --> 04:46.850
Because Nadja...actually likes Keith?

04:47.740 --> 04:50.430
Because if Keith gets caught, she would be sad?

04:51.340 --> 04:52.870
So...for her sake...

04:58.350 --> 04:58.970
That...

04:59.470 --> 05:01.140
There's something wrong with that.

05:03.640 --> 05:06.160
I want you to forget about me.

05:07.420 --> 05:08.400
What are you saying?

05:09.000 --> 05:12.160
I'll contact a lawyer my father befriended...

05:12.550 --> 05:16.480
And also...I'll tell Duke Harcourt and Aunt Emma about the circumstances...

05:16.770 --> 05:17.910
Please forget me...

05:19.710 --> 05:21.510
No...no, I can't!

05:22.650 --> 05:26.840
No matter what, I will free you.

05:27.440 --> 05:27.930
Because...

05:28.520 --> 05:29.610
Because I...

05:31.020 --> 05:31.810
I just...

05:33.760 --> 05:34.550
Mary Ann...

05:35.210 --> 05:36.550
I'm grateful to you.

05:37.240 --> 05:39.760
But don't come here anymore.

05:40.350 --> 05:41.040
No!

05:42.320 --> 05:43.190
Goodbye.

05:43.980 --> 05:44.740
Mary Ann.

05:54.440 --> 05:55.410
What a nice fragrance.

05:56.100 --> 05:56.570
Colette!

05:58.570 --> 06:00.150
What's wrong, darling?

06:01.210 --> 06:01.950
Look at this.

06:03.850 --> 06:06.910
A second Nadja aids the Black Rose...

06:07.800 --> 06:09.730
This girl! I know her!

06:09.730 --> 06:10.200
What?

06:10.660 --> 06:12.610
I met her by chance in Rome.

06:12.790 --> 06:14.610
She isn't a bad girl.

06:15.870 --> 06:17.310
I know it.

06:19.230 --> 06:24.220
A second Nadja has appeared...and Father didn't let me know...

06:24.690 --> 06:25.180
Colette.

06:25.650 --> 06:26.880
Let's go to the police at once.

06:27.670 --> 06:30.120
Let's meet this girl in person and ask her.

06:31.350 --> 06:31.820
Yes.

06:34.930 --> 06:36.360
Let me see Francis!

06:37.720 --> 06:39.330
Rosemary Applefield.

06:40.310 --> 06:41.500
I am Nadja.

06:42.220 --> 06:43.080
You are free.

06:45.650 --> 06:48.140
Then I am freed from suspicion?

06:48.660 --> 06:51.250
Then can Francis leave with me?

06:51.570 --> 06:52.240
Be quiet!

06:53.840 --> 06:55.420
Only you may leave.

06:55.770 --> 06:58.730
By the mercy of Lady Nadja.

07:00.140 --> 07:00.900
Rosemary did...

07:01.550 --> 07:02.530
You're still saying that?

07:02.710 --> 07:04.010
You're Rosemary, aren't you?

07:04.430 --> 07:05.350
I'm not!

07:05.840 --> 07:11.740
It seems that Lady Nadja forgave you, even though you did cruel things, because you were childhood friends.

07:13.540 --> 07:16.800
Really, she has a splendid heart.

07:17.570 --> 07:19.220
You are all being deluded.

07:19.590 --> 07:23.170
If the suspicion hasn't been lifted, then there's no point in me being freed.

07:23.810 --> 07:25.370
Let me see Francis!

07:32.820 --> 07:35.070
Why won't you listen to me?

07:35.490 --> 07:37.740
Francis isn't the Black Rose!

07:37.980 --> 07:39.930
Wait! Wait!

07:40.330 --> 07:41.840
Let me see Francis!

07:42.260 --> 07:43.000
Please!

07:43.510 --> 07:44.160
Nadja.

07:48.720 --> 07:50.110
I saw Francis.

07:50.650 --> 07:51.740
You saw Francis...

07:52.350 --> 07:54.110
How is he?

07:54.550 --> 07:55.020
Is he well--

07:55.020 --> 07:56.100
It's your fault!

07:57.560 --> 08:01.310
If you had just chosen Keith, none of this would have happened.

08:02.920 --> 08:04.180
What are you talking about...?

08:05.310 --> 08:07.020
Because you like Keith...

08:07.540 --> 08:10.840
Francis allowed himself to be caught so he could be his substitute.

08:12.280 --> 08:13.090
What do you mean...

08:13.660 --> 08:14.920
You're always a child, aren't you?

08:15.760 --> 08:17.040
You are a plague!

08:17.610 --> 08:19.900
All you can do is bring Francis misfortune!

08:21.290 --> 08:23.040
Such a...cruel thing...

08:24.170 --> 08:26.320
To me...Francis is...

08:26.960 --> 08:27.950
You love him.

08:28.640 --> 08:29.160
Yes.

08:30.350 --> 08:32.910
You would go to any extent for him?

08:33.260 --> 08:33.880
Yes!

08:34.520 --> 08:35.090
Then...

08:35.730 --> 08:36.810
Go away.

08:39.330 --> 08:43.550
If you don't go to him a second time, he will surely open his eyes.

08:44.250 --> 08:47.600
That's the only way to help Francis.

08:57.580 --> 09:01.350
I...I can't see Francis anymore?

09:02.290 --> 09:03.380
Go away.

09:03.970 --> 09:07.620
That's the only way to help Francis.

09:09.080 --> 09:10.560
Is that really true?

09:19.470 --> 09:20.360
Francis...

09:22.090 --> 09:22.780
Francis...

09:23.970 --> 09:24.780
Francis!

09:29.550 --> 09:30.090
No!

09:30.390 --> 09:33.250
I can't just leave Francis like this!

09:34.950 --> 09:36.660
Huh? That girl?

09:37.840 --> 09:40.480
That girl was freed a while ago.

09:40.830 --> 09:43.200
What? Where did she go?

09:43.320 --> 09:44.310
What is her address?

09:44.460 --> 09:46.380
Well, we don't...

09:52.900 --> 09:56.510
Anyway, I have to let Francis know that I am free.

10:07.100 --> 10:10.360
It seems there's no other way than to ask the Duke directly.

10:11.100 --> 10:11.710
No.

10:12.360 --> 10:15.840
Father definitely wouldn't tell the truth.

10:17.980 --> 10:20.030
But, there is a way.

10:26.820 --> 10:27.510
Nadja!

10:30.280 --> 10:31.640
Ah...Harvey!

10:33.220 --> 10:35.070
Did I come at just the right time?

10:36.080 --> 10:37.440
Are you an escaping prisoner?

11:07.230 --> 11:10.490
There's a big uproar about the Black Rose's capture in Vienna society.

11:11.480 --> 11:13.720
Tomorrow the news will be all over Europe.

11:14.860 --> 11:17.920
The two faces of the successor to the Harcourt Dukedom.

11:18.510 --> 11:22.660
Helping people by day with Nobless Oblige and at night as a thief of justice.

11:22.860 --> 11:24.810
That's what everyone believes.

11:25.940 --> 11:28.440
But I don't understand it.

11:29.840 --> 11:32.930
I pursued him, and I understand him.

11:35.320 --> 11:36.260
In other words...

11:36.950 --> 11:39.620
Francis Harcourt isn't the Black Rose.

11:41.030 --> 11:44.110
And you know who the real Black Rose is.

11:44.430 --> 11:44.900
Yes...

11:46.460 --> 11:47.030
Nadja...

11:50.630 --> 11:53.770
I actually didn't want to tell anybody...

11:54.410 --> 11:56.210
But it's alright since it's you.

11:57.390 --> 11:58.680
The real Black Rose is...

12:07.640 --> 12:09.740
As I suspected, it's Keith Harcourt, isn't it?

12:10.280 --> 12:11.270
As you suspected?

12:11.690 --> 12:13.220
I did some research.

12:14.180 --> 12:17.690
In the Harcourt House, there was an older twin brother of Francis named Keith...

12:18.350 --> 12:24.280
His whereabouts have been unknown since he entered a Swiss nobility school about 6 years ago.

12:25.710 --> 12:28.060
Society was told that he had died.

12:28.500 --> 12:31.690
But in truth, he lived in the shadow world.

12:32.850 --> 12:33.690
Listen, Harvey...

12:34.350 --> 12:35.690
I want to help him.

12:36.100 --> 12:38.130
Both Francis and Keith.

12:38.670 --> 12:40.330
Francis isn't the Black Rose.

12:40.870 --> 12:44.150
Keith is wrong being the Black Rose and a thief...

12:45.190 --> 12:48.690
But he gives all of those things to people in need.

12:49.460 --> 12:50.050
Right.

12:50.870 --> 12:54.320
He stole back my brooch from Herman.

12:54.840 --> 12:57.680
The Black Rose is the one who returned it to me.

12:58.470 --> 13:00.720
That's true. He's like me.

13:00.990 --> 13:01.480
Huh?

13:02.400 --> 13:06.420
Back then, I tried to get the brooch back with my pen.

13:06.720 --> 13:09.900
He stole himself into Herman's mansion.

13:10.490 --> 13:11.900
That's the only difference.

13:12.370 --> 13:13.180
Harvey!

13:13.930 --> 13:16.760
Whatever needs to be done, we will get Herman from behind.

13:17.280 --> 13:22.840
If we do that, nobody will believe his testimony that Francis is the Black Rose.

13:24.660 --> 13:25.730
Rosso and Bianco.

13:26.240 --> 13:26.640
Huh?

13:27.680 --> 13:30.440
Those two were hired by my grandfather.

13:30.890 --> 13:33.650
Employed by Duke Preminger?

13:34.860 --> 13:37.920
That's why if we find them and bring them to Grandfather...

13:38.640 --> 13:40.560
They will expose Herman's lies.

13:41.400 --> 13:41.870
Right.

13:45.200 --> 13:46.140
Mother.

13:47.450 --> 13:49.480
Welcome, sister Colette.

13:49.900 --> 13:53.150
The roses bloomed and I wanted to show them to Nadja.

13:53.500 --> 13:54.310
I'm so happy!

13:55.200 --> 13:56.980
I will call Herman now.

13:59.080 --> 14:00.040
They smell good.

14:01.180 --> 14:04.630
I dreamed of this fragrance while I was still in the orphanage.

14:12.530 --> 14:15.050
You got the brooch back, I see.

14:15.470 --> 14:15.770
Huh?

14:16.930 --> 14:19.820
Yes, Grandfather got it back for me.

14:20.240 --> 14:26.010
He has finally accepted me as his granddaughter and from tomorrow onwards, I will live with him at the mansion.

14:32.180 --> 14:35.020
Mother, you've seen the newspaper, haven't you?

14:35.720 --> 14:36.110
Yes.

14:36.650 --> 14:38.360
Then you know.

14:38.680 --> 14:42.830
The Black Rose was captured and my double appeared.

14:44.530 --> 14:46.700
That girl is called Rosemary.

14:47.150 --> 14:50.310
Ever since we were at the orphanage, she was always daydreaming.

14:51.050 --> 14:55.420
That she was truly a princess and sometime she would be brought to a white castle.

14:56.210 --> 15:01.690
So it must have hurt when she found out that it was me and not her that was a noble daughter.

15:02.250 --> 15:05.510
That's why she lied about being Nadja herself.

15:05.860 --> 15:07.170
She is to be pitied.

15:08.350 --> 15:10.250
I see...is that how it was.

15:11.020 --> 15:11.510
Yes.

15:16.380 --> 15:17.730
She got over it, huh?

15:17.930 --> 15:21.410
But what an exhausting person that Rosemary is...

15:24.890 --> 15:25.610
That's wrong.

15:26.200 --> 15:30.740
The girl I met in Rome wasn't at all how Nadja described her earlier.

15:31.410 --> 15:35.010
She was a vivid girl who held tightly to her own will.

15:35.730 --> 15:37.210
I believe in it.

15:37.850 --> 15:39.780
I will definitely find my mother.

15:41.290 --> 15:42.170
It's strange...

15:42.670 --> 15:43.660
It can't be...

15:43.830 --> 15:46.250
That she is the real Nadja...

15:46.770 --> 15:47.630
This...

15:47.900 --> 15:49.040
It can't be...

16:18.690 --> 16:19.900
Hi, Keith.

16:21.300 --> 16:22.390
What are you doing?

16:29.770 --> 16:34.860
Coming here and calling yourself the Black Rose. What are you trying to do?

16:36.340 --> 16:37.870
A mere caprice.

16:38.490 --> 16:40.160
I'm asking you seriously!

16:43.230 --> 16:47.230
After I saw the newspaper that said you were caught, my pride was wounded.

16:48.040 --> 16:53.030
I wore this mask with conviction and continued to steal with pride.

16:54.340 --> 16:59.100
Even so...I let my face be seen once and you have gotten arrested.

17:00.140 --> 17:04.090
Covering for my sin, you are being punished in my place.

17:04.780 --> 17:06.630
Why are you being such a disgrace?

17:08.430 --> 17:09.990
Run, Francis.

17:13.070 --> 17:14.040
Run away now!

17:14.550 --> 17:16.040
The one who should be here is me.

17:16.260 --> 17:17.590
The thief, Black Rose!

17:18.630 --> 17:19.340
No...

17:19.570 --> 17:20.700
I will stay here.

17:21.540 --> 17:22.110
What?

17:22.750 --> 17:24.800
Keith, you have to be free.

17:26.210 --> 17:28.260
Because the person Nadja truly loves...

17:28.870 --> 17:29.760
...is you, Keith.

17:31.510 --> 17:32.630
What are you saying?

17:33.340 --> 17:35.560
Back then, Nadja chose you, didn't she?

17:40.500 --> 17:41.540
Back then, right.

17:42.700 --> 17:43.830
But now I understand.

17:44.400 --> 17:45.960
When we traveled to Vienna.

17:47.910 --> 17:49.710
Keith is a gentle person from the bottom of his heart!

17:50.330 --> 17:54.350
He also supported me and helped me out greatly.

17:55.540 --> 17:56.130
Yes.

17:56.650 --> 17:58.400
Nadja herself hasn't noticed it...

17:58.890 --> 18:02.820
But the one she truly loves is you, Keith.

18:03.950 --> 18:06.790
Also, you did everything you could to help her.

18:08.990 --> 18:12.420
You were the one to get the brooch back from Herman.

18:13.010 --> 18:15.480
That's why you can make her happy.

18:17.190 --> 18:20.740
Are you saying that Nadja and I can obtain that happiness?

18:21.210 --> 18:21.630
Yes.

18:23.310 --> 18:24.960
You're the same as when we were children.

18:29.280 --> 18:34.100
I was the one who broke our parent's treasured vase.

18:34.710 --> 18:38.570
You said you threw it and got scolded in my place.

18:40.760 --> 18:46.220
You wanted to cover up for me because I was scolded often, but by doing so you made me feel miserable.

18:48.190 --> 18:49.110
It's always like that.

18:49.850 --> 18:54.540
You decide for yourself without considering how other people feel.

18:55.080 --> 18:57.380
But you are deciding on your own too, aren't you?

18:57.650 --> 18:58.220
What?

18:58.740 --> 19:00.220
That mother was unhappy.

19:00.690 --> 19:01.950
That was the truth!

19:02.810 --> 19:07.080
While saying splendid things like Nobless Oblige, she never disobeyed father.

19:07.650 --> 19:10.020
On the contrary, she became sick and died.

19:11.010 --> 19:12.680
I don't think like that.

19:14.540 --> 19:16.070
Mother was a clever person.

19:16.680 --> 19:18.860
She pretended to obey father...

19:19.420 --> 19:22.560
But in the end, she was true to herself and did what she wanted to do.

19:23.320 --> 19:26.260
It was a pity she couldn't leave because she was sick...

19:26.460 --> 19:31.320
But even in bed she wrote letters and cards to the children she couldn't be with.

19:32.340 --> 19:35.200
There was no doubt that she was happy.

19:37.520 --> 19:38.160
Don't be stupid!

19:38.530 --> 19:39.870
She was miserable without fail!

19:40.160 --> 19:43.300
Do you want to believe that mother was that miserable?

19:43.540 --> 19:45.050
I'm not saying such a thing!

19:45.320 --> 19:46.460
Aren't you saying it?

19:50.260 --> 19:52.480
I'm not patient after all.

19:57.960 --> 19:58.650
Francis...

20:00.010 --> 20:01.660
I will find Rosso and Bianco.

20:02.230 --> 20:04.530
If they understand that I am the real Nadja...

20:05.170 --> 20:06.900
You will also be able to get out.

20:08.110 --> 20:10.330
I will do my best with Harvey.

20:11.760 --> 20:14.160
Just wait a little longer, Francis.

20:16.670 --> 20:21.930
Above a quiet forest...

20:22.200 --> 20:27.640
A single shining star,

20:28.700 --> 20:33.190
sings a song of love...

20:30.970 --> 20:31.780
It's Nadja.

20:32.130 --> 20:32.550
Yes.

20:33.410 --> 20:38.700
The wind blows gently in the pasture.

20:39.290 --> 20:44.230
All the little birds and the young kids,

20:44.470 --> 20:49.410
Are held in their mother's embrace.

20:48.270 --> 20:49.430
You and I...

20:49.850 --> 20:50.640
We are the same.

20:49.850 --> 20:55.210
The place where we play in our dreams.

20:51.710 --> 20:55.190
We both wanted mother to be happy.

20:55.560 --> 21:04.120
is a fragrant garden where the flowers bloom.

20:56.000 --> 21:02.100
But mother died a long time ago and now we can't do anything about it.

